{
  "id": "ana10-c7-s2-n102",
  "card_id": "ana10-c7-s2-n102",
  "chapter": null,
  "section": null,
  "number": "102",
  "title": "具有可变积分上限的积分",
  "printed_title": "102. 具有可变积分上限的积分",
  "start_page": 120,
  "start_printed": 114,
  "figures": [],
  "exercise_count": 0,
  "prose": [
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "首先，我们指出，积分与积分变量的符号无关，就是说，",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 114,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0120#21"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "$\\int_a^b f(x)dx=\\int_a^b f(t)dt=\\int_a^b f(z)dz=\\cdots$。",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 114,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0120#22"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "由牛顿-莱布尼兹公式可以得出这个结论：$\\int_a^b f(x)dx=\\left.F(x)\\right|_a^b=F(b)-F(a)$以及　$\\int_a^b f(t)dt=\\left.F(t)\\right|_a^b=F(b)-F(a)$ 等等，就是说，得到的是同一个数。",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 114,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0120#23",
        "p0121#1"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "现在我们来讨论具有可变积分上限的积分（我们用字母$x$ 表示可变的积分上限，而用字母 $t$ 表示积分变量）：$\\int_a^x f(t)dt$。",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 115,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0121#2"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "这个积分是 $x$ 的函数。我们来证明，这个函数的导数$\\left(\\int_a^x f(t)dt\\right)'=f(x)$。　（1）",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 115,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0121#3"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "实际上，根据牛顿-莱布尼兹公式：$\\int_a^x f(t)dt=F(x)-F(a)$，因此$\\left(\\int_a^x f(t)dt\\right)'=[F(x)-F(a)]'=F'(x)-[F(a)]'=f(x)$。",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 115,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0121#4"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "由牛顿-莱布尼兹公式得出：$\\int_a^a f(t)dt=F(a)-F(a)=0$。",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 115,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0121#5"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "所以由 $a$ 到 $x$ 的积分$F(x)=\\int_a^x f(t)dt$是函数 $f$ 的原函数，它在 $a$ 点变成零。",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 115,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0121#6"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "在 $a$ 点取值为 $q$ 的原函数可写成$q+\\int_a^x f(t)dt$。　（2）",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 115,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0121#7"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
